If you want to use layout to control data and axis and label, you can set
the limits a little bit wide enough to show the stuff on the boundary. But I
always put axis and label in the same overlapped layer with data, all the
layer share the same limits, we have to make sure to leave enough space for
showing labels (I don't know if it's a better way??), so as to avoid this
inconvenience.

